    description: "Reported by the WI-hidit fix agent (PR #1555, 2026-10-12); not independently reproduced. The imports edge emitted for -behaviour(X) points at a synthesized placeholder id rather than the in-repo module symbol; left unchanged because the dependency linker parses that placeholder format. The new implements edge does resolve to the in-repo module, so the type relationship is correct; this is only the imports edge. Fix direction: resolve to the in-repo module when present and teach the dependency linker the resolved form, or document why the placeholder is the contract."  # 9e12
